\pard\tx3600\tx3980\tx4340\fs28\li1500\fc0\cf0 Attempts to acquire a lock. This method blocks a thread's execution until the lock can be acquired.\

\fs14 \

\fs28 An application protects a critical section of code by requiring a thread to acquire a lock before executing the code. Once the critical section is past, the thread relinquishes the lock by invoking 
\b unlock
\b0 .\

